      "id": 163543,
      "name": "Ironic",
      "username": "Ironic",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-26T19:19:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Outstanding - curiosity about this had been killing me!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, here's what I caught as new information beyond what we saw in the old thread:</p><ul>\n<li><p><span>They have embraced the rule that you can use Kickers of a different color for a Minor/Major Cost.</span></p></li>\n<li><p><span>Science is now a Power, not a Quality.&nbsp; Tachyon added \"Physics\" to take its place as her d12 Quality, but Unity got some stranger changes - she has no Science, but did add Banter and Creativity.&nbsp; Guys... I think Unity might be neglecting the more formal duties of her internship.</span></p></li>\n<li><p>On the plus side, \"Technopath\" gets called out as a Power in addition to Ferrokinesis.</p></li>\n<li><p><span>It may no longer be possible to take Defense as a reaction by taking a Minor Cost.&nbsp; The possibility is never mentioned.</span></p></li>\n<li><p><span>The Megalopolis Stress Track was 12 boxes, 4 of each color. &nbsp;What we had before on Environment Stress was 3G-XY-3R, so it seems like more Green and Red boxes are on the table.</span></p></li>\n<li><p><span>The GM allowed Create A Bonus to be split among multiple recipients. &nbsp;This did not appear to be official.</span></p></li>\n</ul>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:44:35.328Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 1,
