      "id": 163546,
      "name": "Ironic",
      "username": "Ironic",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-27T16:50:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Heh.&nbsp; My questions, all told, would amount to \"what is the full text of the current beta rules,\" which I don't think Chrono can answer.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> &nbsp; I'm really hoping that the next couple of videos give me a better understanding of Environment Actions, and how Lieutenants work, since those are the biggest mysteries to me right now.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I guess I do have a question, though (if you're listening, Chrono) - at what rate does Stress recover outside of combat?&nbsp; For it that matter, how does a Recover action work - does really give you your Key Die of Stress back?</p>",
