      "raw": "Heh.&nbsp; My questions, all told, would amount to &quot;what is the full text of the current beta rules,&quot; which I don&#39;t think Chrono can answer.  :wink: &nbsp; I&#39;m really hoping that the next couple of videos give me a better understanding of Environment Actions, and how Lieutenants work, since those are the biggest mysteries to me right now.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nI guess I do have a question, though (if you&#39;re listening, Chrono) - at what rate does Stress recover outside of combat?&nbsp; For it that matter, how does a Recover action work - does really give you your Key Die of Stress back?",
