    {
      "id": 163552,
      "name": "Chrono",
      "username": "Chrono",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chrono/{size}/2334_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-28T02:28:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Actually an 8 would have maxed Legacy out as a success. Technically a 4-7 also would have, if he was in the yellow. But yes, recovery during scenes is only available if a hero has a power, so choose wisely!</p>",
